{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26588","headline":"送韩湘赴江西从事 · 姚合","name":"送韩湘赴江西从事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"年少登科客，从军诏命新。\n行装有兵器，祖席尽诗人。\n细雨湘城暮，微风楚水春。\n浔阳应足雁，梦泽岂无尘。\n猿叫来山顶，潮痕在树身。\n从容多暇日，佳句寄须频。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26588.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26588","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}